Subject: [PATCH] Sandbox: Botanist feasibility test, server side (trainer in
 Mos Eisley)

Owner, 14 Oct: Botanist gets the first feasibility test for the new
professions; they enter at IV like every real elite.
- trainerData.lua: trainer_botanist teaches outdoors_botanist_novice.
- trainer_conv.lua: botanistTrainerConvoTemplate (the stock trainer convo).
- trainer_botanist.lua: Bio-Engineer's trainer with a ranger's outfit.
- tatooine_mos_eisley.lua: one trainer 5 m from the outdoor Scout trainer.
The skill rows (outdoors_botanist, outdoors_botanist_novice: needs Hunting IV,
5000 credits, 6 points, 10000 Hunting XP) and the strings ship in
local_planets.tre (tools/hoth/hoth_client_build.py), which the server reads
first on the test galaxy. Generated by tools/owner_content/botanist_server.py;
luac clean. Not yet tried in game.

Agent: Claude
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
